#: index.md:5
#, no-c-format
msgid "InstUI, everywhere"
msgstr "InstUI, overalt"

#: index.md:6
#, no-c-format
msgid "One resolved token model, reshaped into stylesheets, framework bindings, native code, and design-tool payloads."
msgstr "En løst tokenmodell, omformet til stilark, rammebindings, native kode og payloads for designverktøy."

#: index.md:9
#, no-c-format
msgid "Getting started"
msgstr "Kom i gang"

#: index.md:12
#, no-c-format
msgid "The package map"
msgstr "Pakkekartet"

#: index.md:15
#, no-c-format
msgid "API reference"
msgstr "API-referanse"

#: index.md:18
#, no-c-format
msgid "CSS reference"
msgstr "CSS-referanse"

#: index.md:24
#, no-c-format
msgid "One source of truth"
msgstr "Én sannhetskilde"

#: index.md:25
#, no-c-format
msgid "Every package reads the same resolved token IR. Change a token upstream and it flows to CSS, SCSS, native code, and Figma the same way."
msgstr "Hvert pakke leser samme løste token-IR. Endre en token oppstrøms, så flyter den til CSS, SCSS, native kode og Figma på samme måte."

#: index.md:29
#, no-c-format
msgid "Use the smallest package"
msgstr "Bruk den minste pakken"

#: index.md:30
#, no-c-format
msgid "Install just @pantoken/css for a stylesheet, @pantoken/react for hooks and icons, or a bundler preset for Tailwind, Panda, or MUI."
msgstr "Installer bare @pantoken/css for et stilark, @pantoken/react for hooks og ikoner, eller et bundler-preset for Tailwind, Panda eller MUI."

#: index.md:34
#, no-c-format
msgid "Generate for any platform"
msgstr "Generer for alle plattformer"

#: index.md:35
#, no-c-format
msgid "Run `pantoken generate` to emit Swift, Kotlin, Compose, Flutter, Rust, WordPress, and more. The same tokens, in each ecosystem's idiom."
msgstr "Kjør `pantoken generate` for å generere Swift, Kotlin, Compose, Flutter, Rust, WordPress og mer. De samme tokenene, i hver økosystems idiom."

#: index.md:39
#, no-c-format
msgid "No upstream coupling"
msgstr "Ingen oppstrøms avhengighet"

#: index.md:40
#, no-c-format
msgid "The tokens ship vendored as static JSON, so `npm i` never reaches for a GitHub-only source. Publishable, semver'd, offline-friendly."
msgstr "Tokenene leveres som vendorert statisk JSON, så `npm i` trenger aldri å hente fra en GitHub-only kilde. Publiserbar, semver'd, offline-vennlig."
